      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "FYI, Because of this Canny( https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/beta-sdk-330-please-validate-hard-limits-after-processing-preprocess-callbacks-i ), build via Public API should be required for builds using tools that resolve hard limits for now.",
